# macOS / Xcode. project.yml is the source of truth; the .xcodeproj is
# regenerated by `xcodegen generate` and the .xcframework is rebuilt by
# build-aux/build-macos-xcframework.sh. Generated UniFFI Swift bindings
# under apps/macos/StashPlayer/Generated/ ARE committed so the Xcode build
# works without running cargo first.
